'''The Legend Ends''' (伝説のおわり ''Densetsu no Owari'', '''End of the Legend''') is the 48th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Many of these stages can be extremely challenging without counters to the main threats. [[Twilight Zephyr]] requires a lineup strong enough to withstand each of the bosses there, fast units help a lot in [[False Resurrection]], and [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breakers]] and [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave-Immune units]] are almost mandatory for [[Goblet of the Oath]]. Any one of the first six stages could be the hardest depending on one's units, while the last one is ironically the easiest.
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

